# Backport of LLVM commit 7bc3bb0196d593d57ce5acbecd0b3c26e15b83a5
# [ScalarEvolution] Limit recursion in getRangeRef for PHI nodes. (#152823)
# https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/152823
#
# LLVM 16 adaptation retains its LCSSA and IsAvailableOnEntry restrictions and
# omits the newer identical-operands PHI simplification, absent from LLVM 16.
# AddRec construction remains recursive, as in the upstream fix; PHI range
# dependencies are prepared by createSCEVIter rather than nested range queries.

